# --- Large ML assets (kept on disk, out of git) ---
# Raw training corpora, ~90 MB. Re-downloadable from the cited sources and
# needed only to retrain E1.
e1-model/softHack/data/raw/
e1-model/softHack/data/processed/

# The v1 training artifact: model.pkl alone is 214 MB, past GitHub's 100 MB
# per-file limit. The deployable v2 artifact under backend/artifacts/ is
# committed instead — see e1-model/softHack/scripts/export_serving_model.py.
e1-model/softHack/artifacts/

# --- Test output ---
backend/tests_ui/artifacts/

